      "widgets_values": [
        "## models\n\n> [black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein-comfy](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein-comfy) is gated. Log in to Hugging Face and accept the terms on the repository page before downloading.\n\n- diffusion_models\n  - flux3_image_klein_sd_int8_convrot.safetensors (5.83 GB)\n- text_encoders\n  - qwen3vl_4b_int8_convrot.safetensors (4.86 GB)\n  - qwen3.5_9b_flux3_prompt_upsampler_int8_convrot.safetensors (9.75 GB, prompt upsampler / optional)\n- vae\n  - flux2-vae.safetensors (336 MB)\n\n```text\n📂ComfyUI/\n└── 📂models/\n    ├── 📂diffusion_models/\n    │   └── flux3_image_klein_sd_int8_convrot.safetensors\n    ├── 📂text_encoders/\n    │   ├── qwen3vl_4b_int8_convrot.safetensors\n    │   └── qwen3.5_9b_flux3_prompt_upsampler_int8_convrot.safetensors\n    └── 📂vae/\n        └── flux2-vae.safetensors\n```\n\n## guide\n\n- [日本語](https://comfyui.nomadoor.net/ja/basic-workflows/flux-3-image-klein/)\n- [English](https://comfyui.nomadoor.net/en/basic-workflows/flux-3-image-klein/)\n- [中文](https://comfyui.nomadoor.net/zh/basic-workflows/flux-3-image-klein/)"
